{"id": "ru-db8c01f74166.en", "jokeId": "ru-db8c01f74166", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; 'Мент' → 'the cop'. The bribe subtext is weaker in English, but a traffic cop wanting to stay at the crossroads still reads as his habit. Staged at the new nebesa:crossroads: God as the judge at the fork, the cop walks up on 'He came before God', looks back at the two roads, points at the spot on the punchline. Crossroads request dropped.", "title": "The Crossroads", "location": "nebesa", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "ded"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "ded": "god"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A traffic cop died.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He came before God. God asks:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Well, my son, did you do good to people?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Yes, now and then.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "And evil?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "That happened too.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Well then, here are two roads for you, one to heaven, the other to hell.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Whichever you choose, that's where you'll go.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The cop answers:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Could I just stay here, at the crossroads?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "nebesa", "place": "crossroads", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "ded"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "ded": "god"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "baton-striped", "action": "hold"