{"id": "ru-db8c01f74166.de", "jokeId": "ru-db8c01f74166", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; 'Мент' → 'der Bulle' (same colloquial register). The bribe subtext is weaker in German, the traffic cop at the crossing still carries it. Staged at the new nebesa:crossroads: God as the judge at the fork, the cop walks up on 'Er tritt vor Gott', looks back at the two roads, points at the spot on the punchline. Crossroads request dropped.", "title": "Die Kreuzung", "location": "nebesa", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "ded"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "ded": "god"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Verkehrspolizist ist gestorben.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er tritt vor Gott. Der fragt:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Nun, mein Sohn, hast du den Menschen Gutes getan?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Ja, kam vor.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Und Böses?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Auch das kam vor.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Nun, hier hast du zwei Wege, einer führt in den Himmel, der andere in die Hölle.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Welchen du wählst, dahin kommst du.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Bulle antwortet:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Darf ich vielleicht hier an der Kreuzung bleiben?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "nebesa", "place": "crossroads", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "ded"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "ded": "god"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "baton-s