{"id": "ru-6785d1199739.ru", "jokeId": "ru-6785d1199739", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept (only the typo 'Hу' with a Latin H fixed, '..' → '...'). Museum gallery with the new specimen-shelf set piece: the drunk (red nose) stands at it on landscape, his friend with glasses at front-left; the drunk cries over the jars, the friend points at them, the drunk points back on the punchline. Specimen-jar request dropped.", "title": "Три лягушки", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ну просто сердце кровью обливается, как вижу этих заспиртованных животных!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Да что ты, там же всего три лягушки...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вот именно — три лягушки. А спирта — литров десять!!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "museum", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "set": [{"item": "specimen-shelf", "at": "specimen-shelf"}], "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "landscape"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "front-left"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "cry"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
